1
00:00:00,307 --> 00:00:02,397
(Penny:)Sheldon, sweetie, shut up.

2
00:00:03,577 --> 00:00:07,307
(Bernadette:)One of the things that helped me get through
Howard being in space for so long...

3
00:00:07,481 --> 00:00:09,451
(Bernadette:)...was getting married before he left.

4
00:00:12,486 --> 00:00:14,856
(Penny:)Bernadette, sweetie, shut up.

5
00:00:16,256 --> 00:00:18,686
(Raj:)Okay, I have a request to make.

6
00:00:18,859 --> 00:00:21,449
(Amy:)And now he can talk.

7
00:00:21,862 --> 00:00:25,492
(Amy:)I want to cut open your brain
and see what the heck's going on in there.

8
00:00:26,733 --> 00:00:30,103
(Raj:)The only person allowed
inside this head is Dr. Phil.

9
00:00:31,438 --> 00:00:34,338
Anyway, I spoke to my new lady friend
about meeting you all.

10
00:00:34,508 --> 00:00:37,338
(Raj:)She thought it would be easier
for her to start with just one.

11
00:00:37,511 --> 00:00:41,341
(Sheldon:)Gee, I don't know,
my schedule is a little busy.

12
00:00:41,882 --> 00:00:43,682
(Raj:)Actually, I was thinking Leonard.

13
00:00:44,117 --> 00:00:46,547
Well, thank you, Raj, I'd be honored.

14
00:00:46,753 --> 00:00:50,193
(Howard:)What the hell?
I thought I was your best friend.

15
00:00:50,357 --> 00:00:53,057
(Raj:)You are, but you've got
kind of a big personality...

16
00:00:53,260 --> 00:01:00,020
(Raj:)...with your flashy clothes
and your Woody Allen swagger.

